# Example: Add test data files here

This directory should contain:
- Sample CV files (PDF, DOCX)
- Mock API responses
- Test user data
- Sample job descriptions
- Any other test fixtures

Example structure:
```
fixtures/
├── cvs/
│   ├── sample-cv.pdf
│   └── sample-cv.docx
├── jobs/
│   └── sample-job-description.json
└── mocks/
    ├── api-responses.json
    └── user-data.json
```
